@flexiarg operator/add-copy-for-the-question-a-real-person-asked
@title Add Copy For The Question A Real Person Asked
@status accepted 2026-11-11: proposed by 象 for 2 turns (Joe 2026-11-11: recurrence suffices); attested once used in a mission or a War Machine cascade
@provenance 象 proposals, ~/.emacs-graph/session-turn-analysis/<record>[.json].candidates.json; records: turn-BAy58C turn-aBpChD
@parent nomad/letter-from-the-future
@context A public page describes the work and someone close to Joe has asked what vertical it is in.

! conclusion: Add a short line that answers the question in terms the asker would use, and keep it within what is delivered.

  + IF:
    The operator suggests adding something to the page to answer that question.

  + HOWEVER:
    A line written for one person may suit no one else, and promises more than the work delivers.

  + THEN:
    Add a short line that answers the question in terms the asker would use, and keep it within what is delivered.

  + BECAUSE:
    The question shows what a reader looking at the page wants to know.
